---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="联系我们-网络建站公司"
  keywords="网络公司网站,建站公司网"
  description="网络建站公司"
>
  <div
    class="banner-sub"
    style="background-image: url(/static/images/1752639888911529.jpg)"
  >
    <div class="container">
      <div class="inner wow slideInLeft">联系我们</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!--当前位置-->
  <div class="position">
    <div class="container">
      <i></i>当前位置：<a href="/">首页</a> &gt;&gt;
      <a href="/contact.html">联系我们</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <strong>网络建站公司</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="contact clearfix">
        <div class="contact-left">
          <div class="tel">
            全国免费服务热线：<strong>19903970011</strong>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li class="i1">建站咨询：19903970011</li>
            <li class="i2">售后QQ：250801208</li>
            <li class="i3">作息时间：早九点~晚六点</li>
            <li class="i4">地址：河南省郑州市金水区黄河路129号天一大厦1717</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-right">
          <dl>
            <dt class="img-center">
              <img src="/static/picture/1752640585308216.png" alt="微信咨询" />
            </dt>
            <dd>
              <h4>微信咨询</h4>
              <p>
                请扫描二维码<br />
                直接与项目经理沟通
              </p>
            </dd>
          </dl>
          <dl>
            <dt class="img-center">
              <img src="/static/picture/1752737447406114.png" alt="抖音企业号" />
            </dt>
            <dd>
              <h4>抖音企业号</h4>
              <p>
                请扫描二维码<br />
                帮你解答网站疑问
              </p>
            </dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section in-ready" style="background: #f5f5f5">
    <div class="container">
      <h4>我们已经准备好了,你呢？</h4>
      <div class="btn">
        <a
          href="tel:19903970011"
          style="
            border-left: 25px solid #f5f5f5;
            border-right: 25px solid #f5f5f5;
          "
          >获取报价：19903970011</a
        >
      </div>
      <p>2026我们与您携手共赢，为您的企业形象保驾护航！</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <ul class="in-partone clearfix">
        <li class="wow bounceInLeft">
          <div class="wrap">
            <h4>继续在老套路中化作尘埃</h4>
            <a
              href="http://wpa.qq.com/msgrd?v=3&uin=250801208&site=qq&menu=yes"
              rel="nofollow"
              target="_blank"
              >评估旧网站</a
            >
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="wow bounceInRight">
          <div class="wrap">
            <h4>还是厚积薄发重新崛起</h4>
            <a
              href="http://wpa.qq.com/msgrd?v=3&uin=250801208&site=qq&menu=yes"
              rel="nofollow"
              target="_blank"
              >启动新征程</a
            >
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>